            "pk": "18090303211683437",
            "text": "Friends, we have big news!\n\nOn October 14 in Dubai, as part of GITEX Global 2025, we will celebrate the official opening of Tumar Innovation Hub — a new platform that connects Central Asian startups with the Middle Eastern markets.\n\n📍 Venue: Expand North Star, Main Stage\n⏰ Time: 16:00\n\nWhat to expect:\n•opening ceremony and ribbon cutting\n•panel discussion on the future of Central Asia–MENA cooperation \n•new partnerships and MoU\n\nWe believe that Tumar Innovation Hub will become a true bridge for ideas, investments, and collaborations.\n\nJoin us to support our founders and shape the future of technology together!"
